Third-party components NOT included in this directory
-----------------------------------------------------
idds-n is dynamically linked against the following prebuilt libraries.
They are delivered separately (MDS/ship/target/) under their own
commercial licenses and are not covered by this file:

   libidds, libEUC, libmdsheap ... MDS Aero Support Corporation iDDS SDK
                                   (runtime license: mds-license.lic)
   libdds, libdds_cf, libdds_xml,
   libdds_qos_provider ........... CoreDX DDS, Twin Oaks Computing, Inc.

[REVIEW NOTE - remove before commit] Confirm UEI's redistribution rights
for the MDS and CoreDX runtime libraries, and which recipe ships them
(likely ueimds-rootfs), so that recipe can declare their licenses.

Files under MDS/, regression/ and tools/ are not built into idds-n and
are not covered by this summary.


Per-file header format
----------------------
Every source file should start with an SPDX identifier and a copyright
line, for example:

   // SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-UEI-Proprietary
   // Copyright (C) 2018-2026 United Electronic Industries, Inc.
